  "description": "DESXEF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H108 Ce4 O12. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.664-3.924 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.55-109.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H108Ce4O12.",
